Search for an audio visual rental planning timeline and most results hand you a calendar: book 4 to 6 months out for a large conference, 6 to 8 weeks for a wedding or corporate event, 2 to 4 weeks for something small. We are not going to hand you that table. MEG does not track bookings against a week count, and a fixed number ignores what actually decides a booking here: guest count and package fit, what we need from you to quote it accurately, and one real deadline, 24 hours notice, that applies the same whether you book today or next spring.

This page is that honest version, built around how a booking with MEG actually moves from a first inquiry to a delivered setup. If you are planning a wedding specifically, MEG also publishes a wedding focused version of this same question elsewhere on the site, with pricing tied to the Wedding Pack. For our full equipment range, see the [audio visual rental in Malaga](/blog/audio-visual-rental/) guide.

